WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.010
- [Kelly] So, you are so
great in the new movie.

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.660
I love the movie. I
was telling him I love,

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.520
literally my kids loved it so much.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.353
They sent it to us earlier,

00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:07.980
and we watched it like three times.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.990
- [Marlon] Good. Thank you.
- My kids loved it.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.370
And I thought, I kept thinking maybe

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.450
they might be scared at certain things,

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.010
like the the red thing, like pumpkin.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.990
I was like, "Maybe..." But nope.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.390
So when did you know you wanted to act?

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.593
'Cause you're so young.

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.865
- Um, I've always had
like a big personality

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:26.580
ever since I was younger.
Like everywhere I would go,

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.710
I would just make
conversation with people.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:29.543
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:29.543 --> 00:00:32.130
- And I did impersonations
as well when I was younger.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.020
I would impersonate Wendy Williams

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:34.853
when her first show came out.

00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:36.210
[Marlon Laughs]

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.460
- I would walk around
in my mom's blonde wig

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.260
and I would impersonate her.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.750
And I was also into a lot of movies

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.940
that had a lot of drama
to them and suspense.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.650
So I guess a mixture

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.650
of all those things kind
of drew me to acting.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.483
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.810
It was a really, really great film.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.957
I loved y'all's chemistry.
-[Marlon] Thank you

00:00:53.957 --> 00:00:55.050
- [Kelly] it was, it was so fun.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.030
- It was funny cuz I thought she knew,

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.740
I knew her work from 'Stranger Things'

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.660
and I just loved, you know, it was

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.400
like her sassy little attitude.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.160
She always had something
to say and I thought

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.000
for a father to have to deal
with that big personality

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.040
and understand that, it's not wrong.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.900
She's just expressing
herself and you have to

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.940
understand this youth in this culture.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.740
And I thought she knew my work.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.000
This girl ain't no none of my work.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.067
- I did know your work!

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.450
- I said how'd you not see 'White Chicks'

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.189
What is wrong with you child?

00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:24.539
[Kelly Laughs]

00:01:24.539 --> 00:01:25.577
[Audience Claps]

00:01:25.577 --> 00:01:27.385
- I watched 'Scary Movie'.

